{
  "_comment": [
    "Job-assignment map for the parallel portable fan-out (ci-portable-parallel.yml).",
    "Every non-e2e-manifest node of ci/dag/portable.json is assigned to exactly one",
    "job here; the 13 e2e.manifest_* nodes are covered instead by the audited e2e",
    "matrix (target/debug/test-harness plan). ci/check-shard-coverage.sh fails closed if this",
    "map ever drifts from portable.json, and check.shard_coverage below runs it, so the",
    "claim is checked in the lane that executes rather than only in the hosted workflow.",
    "That wording is deliberate: this comment previously said coverage == the trusted DAG",
    "'by construction' while the guard's only caller was .github/workflows/ci-portable.yml.",
    "A correct fail-closed guard with no live reader is indistinguishable from no guard,",
    "and two nodes drifted out of this map behind it -- check.dbt_runtime_abi (corrected",
    "2026-08-21 by 3b6cd503cc) and check.exit_status_class (corrected here).",
    "Node commands live ONLY in portable.json; shards reference nodes by group.job key",
    "and execute them via ci/run-node.sh. Blocks are sized so each job targets <10min."
  ],
  "preflight_nodes": [
    "check.reverie_pin",
    "check.skill_discovery",
    "check.exit_status_class",
    "check.shard_coverage",
    "check.backend_abstraction",
